&lt;p&gt;Joined the site reluctantly, stay here reluctantly&amp;#8230; I do a lot of things in life reluctantly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;My works on the site, in (roughly) alphabetical order:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-4528&quot;&gt;Accendium Lucia (4528)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/breathe-on-me&quot;&gt;Breathe on Me&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/death-and-the-women&quot;&gt;Death and the Women&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-5737&quot;&gt;Entheogen (5737, 5000 contest entry)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/et-sanabitur-anima-mea&quot;&gt;et sanábitur ánima mea&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/ever-only-all&quot;&gt;Ever, Only, All&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/i-say-this-that-you-suffer&quot;&gt;i say this that you suffer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kadakúni
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/light-of-the-north&quot;&gt;Light of the North, Or the Three Impossible Tasks of Te̮la&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/suekni-and-the-firebird&quot;&gt;Sükni and the Firebird&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/the-catching-of-the-sun&quot;&gt;The Catching of the Sun&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Klavigar Character Studies
&lt;ul&gt;
