&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FROM:&lt;/strong&gt; Administrator Wilkes&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; O5 Council&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Council,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I am certainly willing to work with you on whatever matters might be on our agenda, but I need to do so from a position of preparedness and strength. Send those materials immediately. Please.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Administrator Wilkes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FROM:&lt;/strong&gt; THE COUNCIL IN ITS AUTHORITY&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; ADMINISTRATOR XXXX&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ADMINISTRATOR,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PROPOSAL:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SEEING IS BELIEVING. WE WILL SHOW YOU.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VOTES FOR:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
All&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VOTES AGAINST:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
None&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;wiki-content-table&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;STATUS&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: green&quot;&gt;ACKNOWLEDGE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FROM:&lt;/strong&gt; Administrator Wilkes&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; O5 Council&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Council,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your approach is both personally insulting and professionally unacceptable. I have been transitioning many duties from my predecessor, reading notes and past minutes, assessing the strengths and leverage of each business unit and department, and otherwise readying myself for these matters for the better part of a year. If you are not going to demonstrate the courtesy and care due my station, my person, and the Foundation then I will do what I must without you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tantrums are the last thing I expected from this body. Deference? What about cooperation? This is the last olive branch I am going to offer you. I trust you to do the right thing but I will not allow my previous loyalties or the run-away sense of nostalgia that surrounds my office to cause me to be derelict or negligent in my duties.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I await your answer,&lt;br /&gt;
Administrator Wilkes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FROM:&lt;/strong&gt; THE COUNCIL IN EVEN GREATER AUTHORITY&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; ADMINISTRATOR NASCENT&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ADMINISTRATOR,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PROPOSAL:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
REPORT TO SITE-00 FOR NEW EMPLOYEE ORIENTATION&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VOTES FOR:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
All&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VOTES AGAINST:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
None&lt;/p&gt;
