&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FROM:&lt;/strong&gt; Administrator Wilkes&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; O5 Council&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Council,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Administrator Wilkes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FROM:&lt;/strong&gt; THE ONLY FRIEND YOU HAVE&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; MERAKI&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AD MIN,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PROPOSAL:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
?YOU ARE READY?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VOTES FOR:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:1.5em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NONE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VOTES AGAINST:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:1.5em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ALL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;wiki-content-table&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;STATUS&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;FACE IT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FROM:&lt;/strong&gt; The Administrator&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; O5 Council&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Council,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I was told I would be faced with the hardest of decisions from the beginning of my tenure and that the spirit and integrity with which I faced these challenges would set the tone for years. We may either rise to meet the occasion of a challenge&amp;#8230;or we may run from what duty might demand, retreating within procedures, votes, and protocols.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I choose the former.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I choose to act to protect this Foundation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In my authority as Administrator and as designated by the Charter for the Foundation, I hereby dissolve the authority of the body known as the &amp;quot;O5 Council&amp;quot; effective immediately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Facio, ergo sum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Administrator&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FROM:&lt;/strong&gt; O5 Council&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Administrator Michelle Wilkes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Administrator,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PROPOSAL:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
YOU ARE READY.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VOTES FOR:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
All&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VOTES AGAINST:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:1.5em;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;None&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
