&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: green&quot;&gt;APPROVED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:1.5em;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum 06:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:1.25em;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Classification Memo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The following memorandum was issued by Administrator Wilkes and attached to this document along with the Administrator&#039;s personal file-lock. No further changes to this document, even for matters of contextual or procedural clarification, are permitted without the express lifting of this personal file-lock.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border: solid 2px #000000; padding: 1px 15px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ATTN: CLASSIFICATION COMMITTEE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;FROM: ADMINISTRATOR WILKES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Colleagues,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In order to preserve the authority and autonomy of our organization, its sub-divisions, and its appointed personnel, I must declare my first and hopefully only unilateral action as Administrator of the Foundation. You are hereby mandated to construct a new object class and all contingent protocols as advocated by the attached documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While the authority to name this class is at your discretion I offer as a nominee &lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ἀτελής&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; (a-te-lis), a Greek word meaning an unfulfilled or incomplete understanding. The merits of this suggestion should be clear from the attached briefing. Implementation will begin as soon as you ratify the object class.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I am making you complicit in our future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;First, I&#039;m sorry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Second, You&#039;re welcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Good Luck,&lt;br /&gt;
Administrator Wilkes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
