&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;[DARCY]&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Jesus, Kushana, it&#039;s a fucking death trap down here. Those crystals on the wall-&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;[KSHNA]&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;What is it?&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;[DARCY]&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;They&#039;re not crystals, they&#039;re fucking eyes! Something&#039;s eyes!&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
