						 <div style="float:right; margin:0 2em 1em 2em; width:300px; border:0;"> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <td colspan="2"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/local--files/dr-django-bridge-personnel-file/Bridge.jpg" width="300px" alt="Bridge.jpg" class="image" /></td> </tr> <tr> <th colspan="2"><sup>Dr. Bridge, upon successful containment of <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-097">SCP-097</a>.</sup></th> </tr> </table> </div> <p><strong>Name:</strong> Dr. Django Bridge<br /> <strong>Security Clearance:</strong> <strong>5</strong><br /> <strong>Duties:</strong> Archivist</p> <p><strong>History:</strong> [ERATTA DEXPUNGED]</p> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>SCPs Dr. Bridge is responsible for:</strong></span></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-517">SCP-517</a> - Grammie Knows<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-746">SCP-746</a> - Pseudo-Avian<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-808">SCP-808</a> - The Mechanical Choir<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-646">SCP-646</a> - Birth Worm<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-478">SCP-478</a> - Tooth Fairies<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-917">SCP-917</a> - Mr. Moon<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-806">SCP-806</a> - Resurrection Projection<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-569">SCP-569</a> - Heads<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-789">SCP-789</a> - Internet-Savvy Predator<br /> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">SCP-1234 - From Point Pleasant</span> - Lost through temporal flux.<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-886">SCP-886</a> - Nanny<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-097">SCP-097</a> - Old County Fair<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1379">SCP-1379</a> - Stab Your Inner Child<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1479">SCP-1479</a> - Inside-Outside<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1579">SCP-1579</a> - Different Skin<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1679">SCP-1679</a> - Post-Mortem Peoples' Choice<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1779">SCP-1779</a> - Dime Consumers<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-060">SCP-060</a> - Infernal Occult Skeleton<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-013">SCP-013</a> - Blue Lady Cigarettes<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1429">SCP-1429</a> - Organoid Organisms<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2113">SCP-2113</a> - Haunted Liopleurodon Skull<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2840">SCP-2840</a> - Apex Nightmare</p> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Additional:</strong></span></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/critters">Critters</a><br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/i-wanna-be-the-very-best">SCPokemon</a><br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/mr-fish">Mr Fish</a><br /> <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/disciplinary-report-51b-46">Dr Burns Disciplinary Report</a> (Shoop'd)</p> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>From <em><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/competitive-eschatology-hub">Competitive Eschatology</a></em></strong></span></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-red-horse">The Red Horse (The Ironic Metaphor)</a></strong> (by <em>Dexanote</em>): <strong><em>&quot;Today is a</em> very special <em>episode.&quot;</em></strong></li> <li><em><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/internal-memo-regarding-a-theft">Interlude: A Memo Regarding a Theft</a></em> (by <em>Dexanote</em>): <strong><em>Inventory check for Site 62 reveals the absence of SCP-573.</em></strong></li> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-bloody-autumn">The Bloody Autumn</a></strong> (by <em>Dexanote</em>): <strong><em>A child with pale skin, oily black eyes, and bloodied teeth.</em></strong></li> </ul> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Other:</strong></span><br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/stolen-gilded-stolen-saved">stolen-gilded-stolen-saved</a></p> <p><em>Additionally, Dr Bridge has been entrusted with those items previously overseen by other Foundation employees, granted to him through extenuating circumstances.</em></p> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Documents delegated to Doctor Bridge by Doctor █████████</strong></span></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-750">SCP-750</a> - A Different Outlook On Life</p> <p><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/the-long-con">The Long Con</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/sunday-service">Sunday Service</a><br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/what-i-m-here-for">What I'm Here For</a></p> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Items Inherited from Dr. Agatha Rights:</strong></span></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-288">SCP-288</a> - The &quot;Stepford Marriage&quot; Rings<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-291">SCP-291</a> - The Disassembler/Reassembler<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-346">SCP-346</a> - &quot;Pterry&quot; the Pterodactyl<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-347">SCP-347</a> - The Invisible Woman<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-366">SCP-366</a> - Carriage Grubs - Since passed to <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/crayne-author">Dr. D.H. Aeslinger, Psy.D.</a><br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-383">SCP-383</a> - The Variably Useful Flu<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-417">SCP-417</a> - The Plague Tree<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-457">SCP-457</a> - Burning Man<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-467">SCP-467</a> - Confessional Phone Booth<br /> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">SCP-540 &#8212; - &#8212; Carnivorous Blow-Up-Doll</span><br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-542">SCP-542</a> - Herr Chirurg<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-545">SCP-545</a> - Liquid Life<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-561">SCP-561</a> - A Passive Rip in Time<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-715">SCP-715</a> - Clone Booth<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.